  "turns": [
    {
      "text": "Hi everyone. When I present an idea or a flow to stakeholders, I can't draw as fast as I think. Everyone has to wait while I catch up. And afterwards, the rough drawing is hard to revise or share. I thought AI could help the drawing keep up with the explanation. We could visualize our thoughts as we explain the flow. So I built Sprig. It's a canvas-first app. You explain an idea aloud, and OpenAI's GPT Transcribe turns your speech into text. Sprig uses that to update the diagram while you talk. Share your screen in a meeting and everyone can follow the idea as it takes shape. It listens without talking back. That's Sprig. Thanks for watching.",
